  "adminNewAdminTitle": "Create Admin Account",
  "adminNewAdminMenuSubtitle": "How to promote someone to platform admin",
  "adminNewAdminWhyTitle": "This page does not create the account — on purpose",
  "adminNewAdminWhyBody": "Chapter 2.2: admins are created manually in the database; there is no path to becoming an admin from inside the app. The reason is layered security — creating an admin requires Supabase Dashboard credentials, which are separate from the app login. If one admin account is ever compromised, the attacker cannot mint new admins to keep a foothold.",
  "adminNewAdminStep1Title": "Ask the person to sign up themselves",
  "adminNewAdminStep1Body": "Through the normal sign-up page at kamelscan.com/app/register, then verify their email like any other customer. They are born as an Owner with their own trial tenant — that is normal and harmless.",
  "adminNewAdminAliasWarning": "Do not use a Gmail alias such as name+admin@gmail.com. Dots and everything after the plus sign are stripped during the duplicate check, so that address counts as identical to name@gmail.com and the sign-up is rejected. Use a genuinely different email address.",
  "adminNewAdminStep2Title": "Type the email they signed up with",
  "adminNewAdminStep2Body": "The SQL below updates itself to match what you type.",
  "adminNewAdminEmailLabel": "Prospective admin email",
  "adminNewAdminFillFirst": "Enter the email first and the SQL will appear here.",
  "adminNewAdminStep3Title": "Run one command in the Supabase Dashboard",
  "adminNewAdminStep3Body": "Open SQL Editor → New query, paste this, then Run. The result is one sentence naming the person — check that it really is who you meant. If the email is not registered, the command refuses with an explanation instead of silently doing nothing.",
  "adminNewAdminStep4Title": "Tell them to sign out and back in",
  "adminNewAdminStep4Body": "The role travels inside the login token. Until they sign out and back in the app still treats them as an Owner — which looks exactly like the command having failed, when it worked.",
  "adminNewAdminSqlPromote": "Promote to admin — just one line",
  "adminNewAdminListTitle": "Who is an admin right now",
  "adminNewAdminListBody": "Run it before and after you change the role of anyone. No screen in the app shows this list.",
  "adminNewAdminSqlList": "Show the admin list",
  "adminNewAdminMigrationNote": "All three commands on this page require migration 33 to have been run. If Supabase answers \"function does not exist\", run supabase/migrations/33_admin_tools.sql first.",
  "adminNewAdminUndoTitle": "Undoing it if you picked the wrong person",
  "adminNewAdminUndoBody": "Turns them back into an Owner. They still need to sign out and back in. Their tenant is untouched.",
  "adminNewAdminSqlDemote": "Undo — turn back into Owner",
  "adminNewAdminDashboardWarning": "Do not give Supabase Dashboard access to anyone but an Admin. The commands on this page are run there, and anyone with that access can change prices, tokens, and the role of any user without going through the app.",
  "adminPaymentsWaitingSince": "Waiting since {date}",
